      "solutions": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "value": "Upgrade to 1.1.2 or later. The fix resolves and pins the outbound target (resolve_pinned_target plus build_pinned_httpx_client_factory with SniPinningTransport and redirects disabled), so the transport never performs a second DNS lookup."
        }
